[00:19.78] Well I hate to leave you,
[00:23.20] Had to put you down,
[00:35.36] But that way you love, darlin',
[00:38.64] Know I'm Brooklyn bound,
[00:50.64] I ain't got no money,
[00:53.78] Nor a house on that hill,
[01:03.72] But that way you love, darlin',
[01:08.58] Know you give me my fill,
[01:44.46] Well I'm leavin' here, babe,
[01:47.28] Can't say fare you well,
[01:59.06] Well I'm goin' out east, darlin',
[02:01.56] Hope you burn in hell.
